  "notes": "Schema v3. Units stay in the spec's units: Hz, ms, dB, semitones. Omitted keys keep the engine defaults. Each preset may include a sample block. mode is SYNTH, SAMPLE, or LAYER. file and pool entries are paths relative to the samples root (macOS ~/Music/ROLLA/Samples, Windows %USERPROFILE%\\Music\\ROLLA\\Samples), using forward slashes. root is scientific pitch with C4 = 60 (D1 = 26). start and loop times are seconds; loop.end 0 means the file end. layerMix is 0 (synth) to 1 (sample). zones are optional multisample maps {file, root, lo, hi}. slice true (vox) starts each note at the next detected transient. Drums may set voices.kick/snare/clap/rim/tomLow/tomMid/hatC/hatO/ride under DRUMS/{KICK,SNARE,CLAP,RIM,PERC,CH,OH,RIDE}. A missing file keeps the synth and lights the lane warning. Do not commit audio.",
